        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. All carpentry work in buildings and grounds assigned; cabinet work and other work of a creative nature or creating, designing, constructing and installing exhibits, repairing furniture, fabricating work using plastic laminates and acrylics, interior work finishing work, such as kitchen cupboard rebuilding and construction of cabinets and counters, doing layout and construction work from prints and sketches, sign and lettering work. The employee may, on assignment, check work and records and shall possess a thorough knowledge of code requirements relating to this work.",
