        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The General Carpenter/Electrician/Plumber Employee in the carpenter category shall have a minimum of four (4) years experience as a qualified Building Repair Employee and shall have passed an appropriate test in order to demonstrate his or her ability to perform the work of a General Carpenter/Electrician/Plumber Employee. An employee will be allowed one (1) test per twelve (12) month period.",
